<title>USA: Fed seen adding reserves via overnight system RPs.</title>
<headline>Fed seen adding reserves via overnight system RPs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve was expected to add reserves to the banking system via a round of overnight system repurchase agreements on Thursday.</p>
<p>Federal funds were last trading at 5.69 percent, above the Fed's current target of 5.50 percent.</p>
<p>((-- N.A. Treasury Desk 212-859-1660))</p>
</text>
